  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Take 9.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 740,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 22,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Does 8 exist?",
      "start_ms": 1260,
      "end_ms": 2140,
      "start_frame": 38,
      "end_frame": 64,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 2580,
      "end_ms": 3060,
      "start_frame": 77,
      "end_frame": 92,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "So 9 cannot be the beginning.",
      "start_ms": 3740,
      "end_ms": 5280,
      "start_frame": 112,
      "end_frame": 158,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "If we start from 9, we are already entering a sequence from the middle.",
      "start_ms": 5760,
      "end_ms": 9740,
      "start_frame": 173,
      "end_frame": 292,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Take 10.",
      "start_ms": 10280,
      "end_ms": 10940,
      "start_frame": 308,
      "end_frame": 328,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Does 9 exist?",
      "start_ms": 11760,
      "end_ms": 12760,
      "start_frame": 353,
      "end_frame": 383,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 13040,
      "end_ms": 13640,
      "start_frame": 391,
      "end_frame": 409,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, not a start.",
      "start_ms": 14020,
      "end_ms": 15420,
      "start_frame": 421,
      "end_frame": 463,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Take 11.",
      "start_ms": 15860,
      "end_ms": 16500,
      "start_frame": 476,
      "end_frame": 495,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Does 10 exist?",
      "start_ms": 16900,
      "end_ms": 17820,
      "start_frame": 507,
      "end_frame": 535,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "start_ms": 18200,
      "end_ms": 18800,
      "start_frame": 546,
      "end_frame": 564,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a start.",
      "start_ms": 19100,
      "end_ms": 19720,
      "start_frame": 573,
      "end_frame": 592,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Now take 8.",
      "start_ms": 20100,
      "end_ms": 20920,
      "start_frame": 603,
      "end_frame": 628,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Does 7 exist?",
      "start_ms": 21300,
      "end_ms": 22500,
      "start_frame": 639,
      "end_frame": 675,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "start_ms": 22700,
      "end_ms": 23220,
      "start_frame": 681,
      "end_frame": 697,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "So 8 can be the beginning.",
      "start_ms": 23740,
      "end_ms": 24880,
      "start_frame": 712,
      "end_frame": 746,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us the rule.",
      "start_ms": 24880,
      "end_ms": 26440,
      "start_frame": 746,
      "end_frame": 793,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "For any number x, check x minus 1.",
      "start_ms": 27020,
      "end_ms": 29700,
      "start_frame": 811,
      "end_frame": 891,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "If x minus 1 exists, skip x.",
      "start_ms": 30320,
      "end_ms": 32860,
      "start_frame": 910,
      "end_frame": 986,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "If x minus 1 does not exist, this can be a real sequence start.",
      "start_ms": 33200,
      "end_ms": 37220,
      "start_frame": 996,
      "end_frame": 1117,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Only then, walk forward.",
      "start_ms": 37760,
      "end_ms": 39880,
      "start_frame": 1133,
      "end_frame": 1196,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Now put all values into a hash set.",
      "start_ms": 40920,
      "end_ms": 43000,
      "start_frame": 1228,
      "end_frame": 1290,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The duplicate 2 disappears and membership checks become fast on average.",
      "start_ms": 43380,
      "end_ms": 48720,
      "start_frame": 1301,
      "end_frame": 1462,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "One note before the full trace.",
      "start_ms": 48720,
      "end_ms": 51120,
      "start_frame": 1462,
      "end_frame": 1534,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "I will place the values on a number line so the sequence is easy to see.",
      "start_ms": 51980,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "start_frame": 1559,
      "end_frame": 1718,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "That is only our visual explanation.",
      "start_ms": 57780,
      "end_ms": 60080,
      "start_frame": 1733,
      "end_frame": 1802,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "A hash set itself is not sorted.",
      "start_ms": 61140,
      "end_ms": 63480,
      "start_frame": 1834,
      "end_frame": 1904,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's trace every unique value.",
      "start_ms": 64220,
      "end_ms": 66860,
      "start_frame": 1927,
      "end_frame": 2006,
      "word_count": 6
    }
  ],
